t Inn-Spired</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorate </strong>every nook and hollow of your tavern to create everything from bustling taprooms to relaxing reading corners. Place and manipulate <strong>thousands of items</strong> anywhere with <strong>complete creative freedom </strong>and make the tavern of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/eab3012f47467bfe308bfc5972d7e5e6.poster.avif?t=1753137268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/eab3012f47467bfe308bfc5972d7e5e6.webm?t=1753137268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <br>Your Own Item Workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go beyond decorating and become a master artisan by using Tavern Keeper\u2019s powerful <strong>Design Mode</strong> to craft unique furnishings. <strong>Combine </strong>pieces, <strong>add </strong>magical effects, then <strong>share your creations</strong> with the Tavern Keeper community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/e66a9547b2ccceffa954d32aaf366e1d.poster.avif?t=1753137268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/e66a9547b2ccceffa954d32aaf366e1d.webm?t=1753137268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Game, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the single-player campaign your way with <strong>adjustable game mechanics</strong> and <strong>storyteller settings</strong> or play in <strong>Freeplay </strong>for a custom challenge. Pick <strong>Challenging </strong>and strategize over every decision, barely making it through each day, or play a <strong>Relaxed </strong>game running the tavern of your dreams without pressure. The choice is yours.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/ad9bc81c33900beed652c75fcae86755.poster.avif?t=1753137268\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/ad9bc81c33900beed652c75fcae86755.webm?t=1753137268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Our Love Letter to Management Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made by Greenheart Games \ud83d\udc9a (Game Dev Tycoon), a <strong>tiny independent team</strong>, Tavern Keeper is a <strong>passion project</strong> more than a decade in the making. Every detail is <strong>handcrafted</strong>, from the art, sound, writing, animations, down to the <strong>3D user interface</strong> and many <strong>quality-of-life features</strong>. We took no shortcuts to bring you <strong>an experience like no other</strong>. Come on Inn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/436780/extras/faa7639d775f10def7e5a2d5297d29be.webp?t=1753137268\" /></div></p>",
